contents={
'UI1 Body':('Rowan · own body · observer: Rowan', 'Known sensations and recorded findings. Inheritance not investigated.', '''<div class="twocol"><section class="card"><h3>Known body parts</h3><p><span class="badge">Observed</span>Hands · grip tires after hauling.</p><p>Legs · walking feels normal.</p><p class="muted">Internal structures: no reading available.</p><p class="label">Text outline. No inferred hidden organs.</p></section><section class="card"><h3>Useful difference now</h3><p>Grip work is less comfortable.</p><p><span class="badge">Inferred</span>Possible strain. Cause unconfirmed.</p><p><a href="ui5-conditions.html">See recorded changes</a></p><p class="muted">Inspection spends no time.</p></section></div><div class="bodylayers"><dl><dt>Frame and senses</dt><dd>Human · adult stage · average height.<br>Handedness: stated right-handed.</dd><dt>Constitution / physique</dt><dd>No diagnostic reading available. This does not establish absence.</dd><dt>Lineage faculties</dt><dd>Family reports a cold-tolerance trait. No transmission reading.</dd></dl><dl><dt>Genetics</dt><dd>Inheritance not investigated.</dd><dt>Adaptation / condition</dt><dd>Grip discomfort observed today. See condition log for timing.</dd><dt>Person and address</dt><dd>Rowan states they/them.<br>Body characteristics: unspecified.<br>Reproductive role: not established.</dd></dl></div><details><summary>Training and known effects</summary><p>Running practice is recorded independently of inherited traits. A known skill links to its existing practice notes.</p></details>''', '<button disabled>Open recovery actions</button><p>Mock route. An actual service shows its quote before work.</p>'),
'UI2 Family':('Rowan household · only known people and relations', 'Claims and records stay separate from biological proof.', '''<div class="twocol"><section class="tree"><div class="card"><h3>Mira</h3><p>Reported parent of Rowan.</p><p><span class="badge">Stated</span>Family account · undated.</p></div><div class="relation">Reported parent relation</div><div class="card"><h3>Rowan · selected</h3><p>Cold tolerance: family report.</p><p>Concentration: no reading available.</p></div><div class="relation proof">Adoption recorded · household register</div><div class="card"><h3>Elin</h3><p>Adopted family member.</p><p>Biological relation not established.</p></div></section><section class="card"><h3>Selected relation evidence</h3><p><span class="badge">Stated</span>Mira reports parentage.</p><p><span class="badge">Recorded</span>Household register records Mira as guardian.</p><p class="warning">Guardianship does not prove biological descent.</p><dl><dt>What is established</dt><dd>Household and guardian role.</dd><dt>What is unresolved</dt><dd>Parentage not independently tested.</dd><dt>Faculty reading</dt><dd>No known measurement of transmission or concentration.</dd></dl><p><a href="ui1-body.html">Inspect Rowan's known body</a></p><p class="label">No hidden relative counts or ancestor placeholders.</p></section></div>''','<a href="ui3-heirs.html">Compare successors</a><a href="ui4-match.html">Plan traits</a><p>Both tools are learned in this synthetic fixture.</p>'),
'UI3 Heirs':('Continue the workshop · comparison only', 'People keep their own agency. No overall heir score.', '''<table class="comparison"><caption>Known candidates and actual legacy routes</caption><thead><tr><th>Question</th><th>Elin<br><span class="label">Adopted kin</span></th><th>Jori<br><span class="label">Apprentice</span></th><th class="wide-only">Neri<br><span class="label">Recorded kin</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Expressed traits</th><td>Cold tolerance reported</td><td>No reading available</td><td class="wide-only">No reading available</td></tr><tr><th>Training</th><td>Observed tailoring</td><td>Workshop lessons recorded</td><td class="wide-only">Caravan work reported</td></tr><tr><th>Temperament</th><td>Patient during lessons, observed</td><td>Careful with tools, observed</td><td class="wide-only">Not observed</td></tr><tr><th>Standing</th><td>Household member, recorded</td><td>Guild apprentice, recorded</td><td class="wide-only">Kin claim recorded</td></tr><tr><th>Willingness / access</th><td>Not discussed</td><td>Willing to learn, stated; local</td><td class="wide-only">Away; no current report</td></tr><tr><th>Legacy carrier</th><td>Tools may be bequeathed by deed</td><td>Written lessons can be left</td><td class="wide-only">Deed route not established</td></tr><tr><th>Body faculty transfer</th><td>Transmission not established</td><td>Teaching does not copy anatomy</td><td class="wide-only">Transmission not established</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="warning">Recognition, estate access and inherited faculty are different questions.</p><details><summary>What succession terms must establish</summary><p>Recipient agreement, available estate, transfer route, losses, time/world continuity and the final commitment. This comparison commits nothing.</p></details>''','<button disabled>Open succession terms</button><p>Mock only. Candidate selection is not succession.</p>'),
'UI4 Planner':('Rowan + Jori · illustrative authored test model', 'Inspection forecast only. No relationship, child or random roll created.', '''<div class="twocol"><section class="card"><h3>Inputs that can be used</h3><p>Rowan: <span class="badge">Measured</span>Aa</p><p>Jori: <span class="badge">Measured</span>Aa</p><p class="muted">Synthetic clinic tests, locus A only. Both input records are known.</p><p>Model: simple independent single-locus transmission.</p><p class="warning">This model is an invented example, not real genetics or a universal world law.</p></section><section class="card"><h3>Conditional locus forecast</h3><div class="smallrow"><span>AA</span><strong>25%</strong></div><div class="smallrow"><span>Aa</span><strong>50%</strong></div><div class="smallrow"><span>aa</span><strong>25%</strong></div><p>Expression / development: not estimated.</p><p>Whole-child traits: not estimated.</p></section></div><section class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><h3>If those tests were unknown</h3><p>No reliable estimate. Visible expression alone does not establish carried variants.</p><p>Known next evidence route: ask the clinic about this test's scope and terms.</p><p>Body role / method eligibility: not established by identity, address or the locus test.</p></section><details><summary>Assumptions and missing evidence</summary><p>Forecast is conditional on the two test inputs and the authored model being applicable. It excludes mutation, other loci, development and environment. No secret backend values tighten the result.</p></details>''','<button disabled>Review clinic test terms</button><p>Mock only. Reading odds is free; real tests have a separate quote.</p>'),
'UI5 Conditions':('Rowan · current world calendar · played time', 'Current status stays visible while the historical reading region scrolls.', '''<div class="card warning"><h3>Current: grip discomfort</h3><p><span class="badge">Observed</span>Today after hauling. Recovery time unmeasured.</p><p>No other condition events recorded. This is not a clean bill of health.</p></div><p class="links"><span class="badge">All recorded</span><span>Injury</span><span>Substances</span><span>Stress</span><span>Acclimation</span></p><ol class="timeline"><li><time>Day 1 · 08:10 · observed</time><h3>Hands ache after hauling</h3><p>Grip feels weaker. Location: village yard. Cause not diagnosed.</p></li><li><time>Day 1 · 08:25 · stated</time><h3>Clinic note: possible strain</h3><p>Examiner's report. Suggests rest; no measured expiry.</p></li><li><time>Day 1 · 09:00 · observed</time><h3>Comfort improves after rest</h3><p>Better grip reported by Rowan. Ongoing status has not been re-examined.</p></li><li><time>Day 1 · 10:00 · recorded intervention</time><h3>Rest plan recorded</h3><p>No substance exposure, stress or acclimation events are known in this fixture.</p></li></ol><details><summary>Clock and history scope</summary><p>Entries use the same local played-time calendar in this fixture. Cross-world records retain source clocks and uncertainty. A later diagnosis appends a correction rather than rewriting the old report.</p></details>''','<button disabled>Open known care route</button><p>Mock only. No treatment or timer advances here.</p>'),
'UI6 Skins':('Same known facts · four illustrative presentations', 'Frames change; role tints and evidence semantics remain stable.', '''<div class="skins"><section class="card skin" style="--accent:#d9c799"><h3>Doctor's notes</h3><p class="source">Village clinic · observation</p><p>Grip discomfort after hauling.</p><p>Possible strain, not confirmed.</p><p>No inheritance reading available.</p></section><section class="card skin" style="--accent:#8fd3b4"><h3>Clan ledger</h3><p class="source">Household entry · observation copied</p><p>Grip discomfort after hauling.</p><p>Possible strain, not confirmed.</p><p>No inheritance reading available.</p></section><section class="card skin scan" style="--accent:#9dbfe9"><h3>Instrument record</h3><p class="source">Clinic report · no live scan</p><p>Grip discomfort after hauling.</p><p>Possible strain, not confirmed.</p><p>No inheritance reading available.</p></section><section class="card skin" style="--accent:#e5c580"><h3>Status window</h3><p class="source">Known report · no diagnostic grant</p><p>Grip discomfort after hauling.</p><p>Possible strain, not confirmed.</p><p>No inheritance reading available.</p></section></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><h3>Display choice does not become a test</h3><p>A scanner-shaped record has the same clinic evidence until a real scan occurs. A system-shaped record grants no extra knowledge.</p><p>Player Appearance wins. Unreached worlds never enter the style menu.</p><p class="label">This comparison is a documentation fixture. A player's real menu includes only discovered styles.</p></div><details><summary>Other fitting frames</summary><p>Scholarly notes can annotate known local methods. Distributed-body records show known members and communication reach. Neither frame supplies hidden mechanisms.</p></details>''','<a href="ui1-body.html">Return to Body</a><p>No skin choice changes facts, actions or uncertainty.</p>')}
nav=''.join(f'<a href="{f}">{label}</a>' for f,label,_,_ in views)
